      "Quick-Frozen Dumplings",
      "",
      "I went to the supermarket yesterday to buy quick-frozen dumplings, where a product promoter was boiling dumplings.",
      "She greeted me warmly, grabbing my arm to say: “Try it, please!”",
      "I couldn’t refuse her so I had to eat one.",
      "The girl stared at me while I was eating.",
      "When I finished, she asked with concern: “Is that cooked? Can I give them out?” Oh god!"
